We are sitting in my living room.
We are eating dinner together.
Outside, heavy rain is falling.
But inside, it is a very warm atmosphere.
Asha, Rohan, and Priya are chatting.
I look at my friends.
I am feeling a lot of contentment.
I think about my Mumbai journey.
I came to Mumbai in January.
I came here just for a job.
But now six months have passed.
I have built a new life here.
Rohan asks me.
"Maya, did you like the dinner?"
I answer him, "Yes Rohan, it is very tasty."
Asha says, "You have become a true Mumbaikar now."
I smile and say yes.
This is my first birthday away from home.
But today I am not alone.
